  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">East and Southern Africa Association of Accountants General (ESAAG) 2010 - 2012 - ESAAG 2010-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">East and Southern Africa Association of Accountants General (ESAAG) 2010 - 2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ESAAG is a non-profit association of Accountants General in East and  Southern Africa, constituted to support the Accountants General&apos;s     Offices to develop sound PFM practices by providing: A knowledge      base; Networking and information sharing opportunities; Advice on PFM legislation framework; Regional and international representation and  promoting cooperation; Providing and/or supporting capacity building.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ESAAG &#xe4;r en sammanslutning av Accountants General (motsv ESV i        Sverige)i &#xf6;stra och s&#xf6;dra Afrika. ESAAG arbetar med                   kapacitetsutveckling, fr a gnm utbildning, av sina                    medlemsorganisationer och dessas personal.</narrative>
  </description>
